tack it.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>The amount of hit points of this dragon changed two times after being introduced with the Tibia's 20th Anniversary celebrations. Two years later, on January 2019, <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Piñata Dragons</strong> were re-introduced in the game as part of the recurring <a href=\"#/quest/tibia-anniversary\">Tibia Anniversary</a> celebrations that started to take place every year. The loot of the Piñata Dragons was slightly altered in order to preserve the items exclusive to the 20th Anniversary, namely the Birthday Backpack, Bottle of Tibian Wine and the Birthday Cake, which were replaced by the more generic <a href=\"#/wiki/Festive%20Backpack\">Festive Backpack</a>, Winterberry Liquor and Meringue Cake. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras%20Puppet\">Ferumbras Puppet</a> was also added to their loot.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,656 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\"><img alt=\"Candy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_419a89.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\">Candy</a></td>\n<td></td>\n